WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.985
For an evening handover, read the current status and identify who is responsible before writing.

00:00:05.985 --> 00:00:12.635
In Resolution Log choose Follow-up, name the shift, the equipment and the next action, then submit.

00:00:12.635 --> 00:00:19.925
Read the saved entry back and check the owner separately; a follow-up records work to do but does not transfer responsibility.
